=head1 NAME

_MASK_FTS_PORT_ - Mask approximate areas of subarrays corresponding to FTS-2 ports

=head1 SYNOPSIS

    _MASK_FTS_PORT_

=head1 DESCRIPTION

This primitive masks SCUBA-2 data to retain only the part of each subarray
corresponding approximately to the FTS-2 ports.

The files are assumed to be cubes corresponding to the bolometer array
such that the FTS-2 ports are found within a circle of radius 16 pixels
centered at position (15, 23).

=head1 OUTPUT FILES

The masked files are placed in the frame with a C<_msk> suffix.

